{"title":"Marketing Executive Roadmap","role":"Marketing Executive","summary":"A Marketing Executive supports customer acquisition, brand communication, campaigns, market research, content, digital marketing, lead generation and marketing analytics. For a BBA/BMS/BBM General graduate, this is a strong and direct entry-level career pathway.","facts":{"Starts":"Year 1 UG · 2026","Current degree":"BBA / BMS / BBM General"},"about":[{"label":"Typical degree duration","text":"3 or 4 years depending on university structure"},{"label":"Career alignment","text":"Strong/direct"},{"label":"Primary route","text":"BBA → Marketing Internship → Marketing Executive/Marketing Associate → Senior Marketing Executive → Marketing Specialist/Assistant Manager → Marketing Manager"}],"intro":[],"horizons":[{"period":"2026–2030","question":"What can I enter now?","output":"Marketing intern, digital marketing intern, marketing executive/associate"},{"period":"2030–2035","question":"How should I specialise?","output":"Digital marketing, performance marketing, content, SEO, brand, CRM or marketing analytics"},{"period":"2035–2040","question":"How should I evolve?","output":"Marketing Specialist, Assistant Manager, Growth Manager or Brand Manager"},{"period":"2040–2046","question":"How can I remain relevant?","output":"Marketing Manager, Growth Lead, Brand Head, Marketing Director or CMO-track role"}],"sections":[{"heading":"Overview","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"The modern marketing professional should combine:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Marketing Fundamentals","Digital Marketing","Sales","Analytics","Content","Customer Psychology","AI"],"sep":"+"}]},{"heading":"Career-route check","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Strong/direct alignment."},{"type":"p","text":"BBA General provides a broad business foundation. The student should specialise through practical work in:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Marketing"},{"text":"Consumer behaviour"},{"text":"Market research"},{"text":"Digital marketing"},{"text":"Sales"},{"text":"Branding"},{"text":"Content"},{"text":"SEO"},{"text":"Social media"},{"text":"Performance marketing"},{"text":"CRM"},{"text":"Marketing analytics"}]},{"type":"p","text":"A student who only studies theoretical marketing may struggle to compete with candidates who can demonstrate campaign results, analytics and customer acquisition experience."}]},{"heading":"Career horizons","kind":"horizons","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"These are planning horizons, not guaranteed promotion timelines."}]},{"heading":"What to build each year","kind":"build","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["When","Build this","Learn from","Proof of progress","Gap it moves"],"rows":[[{"text":"Year 1 Sem 1"},{"text":"Marketing fundamentals + consumer behaviour"},{"text":"University + NPTEL","url":"https://nptel.ac.in/"},{"text":"Market research report"},{"text":"Marketing foundation"}],[{"text":"Year 1 Sem 2"},{"text":"Content + social media"},{"text":"Practical brand projects"},{"text":"30-day content campaign"},{"text":"Content capability"}],[{"text":"Year 2 Sem 1"},{"text":"SEO + digital marketing"},{"text":"Official platform resources"},{"text":"SEO audit + keyword research"},{"text":"Digital capability"}],[{"text":"Year 2 Sem 2"},{"text":"Performance marketing + analytics"},{"text":"Platform learning + projects"},{"text":"Campaign simulation"},{"text":"Acquisition capability"}],[{"text":"Year 3 Sem 1"},{"text":"Marketing internship"},{"text":"Industry"},{"text":"Internship + campaign results"},{"text":"Employability"}],[{"text":"Year 3 Sem 2"},{"text":"Marketing analytics + CRM"},{"text":"Power BI/SQL + CRM resources"},{"text":"Marketing dashboard"},{"text":"Differentiation"}],[{"text":"Year 4 Sem 1 (if applicable)"},{"text":"Brand/growth strategy + AI"},{"text":"NPTEL + industry"},{"text":"Integrated campaign"},{"text":"Strategic capability"}],[{"text":"Year 4 Sem 2 (if applicable)"},{"text":"Placement + portfolio"},{"text":"Employers + mock interviews"},{"text":"Job offer"},{"text":"Career entry"}]]},{"type":"h","text":"Core marketing skill stack"},{"type":"h","text":"1. Marketing fundamentals"},{"type":"p","text":"Master:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Marketing mix"},{"text":"Segmentation"},{"text":"Targeting"},{"text":"Positioning"},{"text":"Consumer behaviour"},{"text":"Market research"},{"text":"Product lifecycle"},{"text":"Pricing"},{"text":"Distribution"},{"text":"Branding"},{"text":"Customer experience"},{"text":"Competitive analysis"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Understand:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Market","Segment","Target","Position","Offer","Acquire","Retain"]}]},{"heading":"Consumer behaviour","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Customer needs"},{"text":"Buying behaviour"},{"text":"Decision-making"},{"text":"Customer journey"},{"text":"Motivation"},{"text":"Perception"},{"text":"Brand preference"},{"text":"Customer segmentation"},{"text":"Purchase intent"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Build customer personas based on evidence, not stereotypes."}]},{"heading":"Digital marketing","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Search Engine Optimisation"},{"text":"Search Engine Marketing"},{"text":"Social media marketing"},{"text":"Email marketing"},{"text":"Content marketing"},{"text":"Influencer marketing"},{"text":"Affiliate marketing"},{"text":"Performance marketing"},{"text":"Landing pages"},{"text":"Conversion optimisation"},{"text":"Marketing automation"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Understand the funnel:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Awareness","Interest","Consideration","Conversion","Retention","Advocacy"]}]},{"heading":"Content marketing","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Build skills in:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Copywriting"},{"text":"Social media posts"},{"text":"Short-form video concepts"},{"text":"Blog writing"},{"text":"Email campaigns"},{"text":"Landing-page copy"},{"text":"Ad copy"},{"text":"Content calendars"},{"text":"Brand storytelling"}]},{"type":"p","text":"The student should create a portfolio rather than simply claiming “social media knowledge.”"}]},{"heading":"SEO","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Keyword research"},{"text":"Search intent"},{"text":"On-page SEO"},{"text":"Technical SEO basics"},{"text":"Internal linking"},{"text":"Content optimisation"},{"text":"Backlink fundamentals"},{"text":"Search Console concepts"},{"text":"SEO analytics"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Portfolio project"},{"type":"p","text":"Perform an SEO audit of a real or permitted test website and produce:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Issue","Evidence","Recommendation","Expected impact"]}]},{"heading":"Performance marketing","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Understand:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"CPC"},{"text":"CPM"},{"text":"CTR"},{"text":"Conversion rate"},{"text":"CPA"},{"text":"ROAS"},{"text":"CAC"},{"text":"LTV"},{"text":"Landing-page conversion"},{"text":"Attribution basics"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Build campaign simulations for:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Google Ads"},{"text":"Meta Ads"},{"text":"LinkedIn Ads"},{"text":"E-commerce campaigns"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Actual ad-platform interfaces and policies change, so use current official training resources when preparing for live campaigns."}]},{"heading":"Marketing analytics","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"This is one of the strongest differentiators for a BBA graduate."},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Excel"},{"text":"Power BI"},{"text":"SQL"},{"text":"Basic statistics"},{"text":"Data visualisation"},{"text":"Customer segmentation"},{"text":"Funnel analysis"},{"text":"Cohort analysis"},{"text":"Campaign analysis"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Microsoft Power BI","url":"https://www.microsoft.com/power-platform/products/power-bi"},{"type":"p","text":"Build dashboards showing:"},{"type":"lis